      {
        "id": "folio-0569cd3d34fd1dcab25b-p1-b12-1",
        "inline": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "Development of corner happens on GitHub and any issues can be raised there (Foreman-Mackey 2016). corner has been used extensively in the astronomical literature and it has occasionally been cited as corner.py or using its previous name triangle.py. The source code for corner has been archived to Zenodo and it has the DOI (Zenodo Archive 2016)"
          }
        ],
